{"version":"1.6.0-alpha.8","notes":"## 1.6.0-alpha.8 - 2026-11-02\n\n### Fixes\n\n- Prevent received text, images, and files from being automatically sent back to the originating device on macOS (#2190)\n- Fix copying the same content again on macOS being ignored instead of syncing (#2196)\n- Keep new history entries visible when you are at the top of the list (#2191)\n- Remove duplicate file transfer progress displays from history and file previews (#2192)\n- Show UniClipboard as the application name in the macOS Dock (#2193)\n- Keep the quick panel's action menu visible while navigating its options (#2194)\n- Show full keyboard shortcuts at the end of quick panel rows (#2195)\n\n<!-- zh -->\n\n## 1.6.0-alpha.8 - 2026-11-02\n\n### Fixes\n\n- 修复 macOS 上收到的文本、图片和文件被自动回传给来源设备的问题 (#2190)\n- 修复 macOS 上再次复制相同内容时被忽略、未能同步的问题 (#2196)\n- 修复停留在历史记录列表顶部时，新记录未保持可见的问题 (#2191)\n- 移除历史记录和文件预览中重复的文件传输进度显示 (#2192)\n- 修复 macOS 程序坞中的应用名称，使其正确显示为 UniClipboard (#2193)\n- 修复在快捷面板操作菜单中切换选项时菜单消失的问题 (#2194)\n- 在快捷面板每行末尾显示完整的键盘快捷键提示 (#2195)","confirmation_required":false,"confirmation_description":null,"pub_date":"2026-11-02T07:48:57Z","platforms":{"linux-aarch64":{"signature":"","url":"https://release.uniclipboard.app/artifacts/v1.6.0-alpha.8/UniClipboard_1.6.0-alpha.8_aarch64.AppImage.tar.gz"},"linux-x86_64":{"signature":"","url":"https://release.uniclipboard.app/artifacts/v1.6.0-alpha.8/UniClipboard_1.6.0-alpha.8_amd64.AppImage.tar.gz"},"windows-aarch64":{"signature":"","url":"https://release.uniclipboard.app/artifacts/v1.6.0-alpha.8/UniClipboard_1.6.0-alpha.8_arm64-setup.exe"},"windows-x86_64":{"signature":"","url":"https://release.uniclipboard.app/artifacts/v1.6.0-alpha.8/UniClipboard_1.6.0-alpha.8_x64-setup.exe"},"darwin-aarch64":{"signature":"","url":"https://release.uniclipboard.app/artifacts/v1.6.0-alpha.8/UniClipboard_aarch64-apple-darwin.app.tar.gz"},"darwin-x86_64":{"signature":"","url":"https://release.uniclipboard.app/artifacts/v1.6.0-alpha.8/UniClipboard_x86_64-apple-darwin.app.tar.gz"}}}